  "verseCount": 8,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "101",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 101"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "101",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will sing of mercy and judgment: unto thee, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.101.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.101.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", will I sing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will behave myself wisely in a perfect way. O when wilt thou come unto me? I will walk within my house with a perfect heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will set no wicked thing before mine eyes: I hate the work of them that turn aside;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.101.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.101.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall not cleave to me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A froward heart shall depart from me: I will not know a wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "person",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.101.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.101.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoso privily slandereth his neighbour, him will I cut off: him that hath an high look and a proud heart will not I suffer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mine eyes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.101.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.101.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the faithful of the land, that they may dwell with me: he that walketh in a perfect way, he shall serve me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that worketh deceit shall not dwell within my house: he that telleth lies shall not tarry in my sight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 101:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will early destroy all the wicked of the land; that I may cut off all wicked doers from the city of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.101.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.101.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.101.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.101.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
